  "description": "About CTF (Capture The Flag): Capture The Flag (CTF) is an exciting cybersecurity competition designed to challenge participants' technical skills, analytical thinking, and problem-solving abilities. Participants will solve a series of security-related challenges involving areas such as cryptography, web security, digital forensics, reverse engineering, and other cybersecurity concepts. Each challenge contains hidden flags that participants must discover and submit to earn points. CTF provides an opportunity to apply practical cybersecurity knowledge, explore real-world security concepts, and test skills in a competitive environment. Get ready to think like a security analyst, investigate digital clues, and capture the flags! December 03rd, 2026 Location: GM University, Davangere Event Participation & Benefits: We are excited to welcome all participants to IGNITRON 2K26. Here are some important details regarding registration and accommodations: Registration Fee: ₹500 Accommodation: For participants arriving from outside Davangere, accommodation will be arranged on a payable basis to ensure a comfortable stay. The accommodation details and payment link will be shared with the selected participants at the appropriate time. Teams are requested to fill out the accommodation form promptly once it is released. Important Note: You must first complete the registration process through the official Unstop platform. Participants must follow the rules and regulations specified by the organizing team. For any queries, feel free to reach out to our team. We look forward to seeing you at IGNITRON 2K26!",
